#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:951
#: 9090468d614145b8a0376a57e477b048
msgid "Desktop Environments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:953
#: 2490b595361041f7b6cd019fe48a6b9d
msgid ""
"The desktop GUIs that QubesOS supports out of the box are `KDE <https://kde."
"org>`__ and `Xfce <https://xfce.org>`__. All GUI tools should function well "
"under both of those desktop environments. There is also a significant "
"minority of users who use tiling desktop environments. Ideally, GUI tools "
"should also function in those desktop environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:955
#: d1ee4b6b54d247cbb1a19356feb847af
msgid ""
"Both of those desktop environments have their own `human interface "
"guidelines <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_interface_guidelines>`__, "
"and we suggest you familiarize yourself with the platform you developing for."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:957
#: 064dd470f9b941409d5622f9053bed20
msgid "`KDE HIG <https://hig.kde.org/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:959
#: 55e4c7ef29324495954e329f30955538
msgid "`Xfce UI Guidlines <https://wiki.xfce.org/dev/hig/general>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:962
#: bc576a96fbf74470b746d652b93e37f1
msgid "Further Learning & Inspiration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:964
#: 3458a890d34f414db5e37e2fe028a457
msgid ""
"Learning to make well designing intuitive interfaces and software is "
"specialized skillset that can take years to cultivate, but if you are "
"interested in furthering your understanding, we suggest the following "
"resources:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:966
#: 4ea1e64927724f18adee358f77dcae41
msgid ""
"`Learn Design Principles <https://web.archive.org/web/20180101172357/http://"
"learndesignprinciples.com/>`__ by Melissa Mandelbaum"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:968
#: 9d02a35d181f4159889cc46833c3228d
msgid ""
"`Usability in Free Software <https://jancborchardt.net/usability-in-free-"
"software>`__ by Jan C. Borchardt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:970
#: 718e610f49b74e899c9376506f8a8916
msgid ""
"`Superheroes & Villains in Design <https://vimeo.com/70030549>`__ by Aral "
"Balkan"
msgstr ""

